*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion:   "1.1"
*LanguageVersion: English 
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName:    "DJVU.PPD"
*Manufacturer:  "Generic"
*Product:       "(Generic DjVu Printer)"
*cupsVersion:   1.0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber:  2
*ModelName:     "Generic DjVu Printer"
*ShortNickName: "Generic DjVu Printer"
*NickName:      "Generic DjVu Printer"
*PSVersion:     "(3010.107) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice:   True
*DefaultColorSpace: CMYK
*FileSystem:    False
*Throughput:    "30"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer:  Type42
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Generic;CMD:PJL,PDF;MDL:DjVu Printer;CLS:PRINTER;DES:Generic DjVu Printer;DRV:DPDF,R1,M0;"
*JCLBegin:            "<1B>%-12345X@PJL JOB<0A>"
*JCLToPDFInterpreter: "@PJL ENTER LANGUAGE = PDF<0A>"
*JCLEnd:              "<1B>%-12345X@PJL EOJ <0A><1B>%-12345X"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 -"

*OpenGroup: General/General
*JCLOpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 100 JCLSetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "@PJL SET PAPER=LETTER<0A>"
*PageSize A4/A4: "@PJL SET PAPER=A4<0A>"
*PageSize A5/A5: "@PJL SET PAPER=A5<0A>"
*JCLCloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenGroup: Output/Output Options
*JCLOpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 100 JCLSetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 dpi: "@PJL SET RESOLUTION=300<0A>"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "@PJL SET RESOLUTION=600<0A>"
*Resolution 1200dpi/1200 dpi: "@PJL SET RESOLUTION=1200<0A>"
*JCLCloseUI: *Resolution
*CloseGroup: Output

*% Generic boilerplate PPD stuff
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
*Font Symbol: Special "(001.007S)" Special ROM
*Font ZapfDingbats: Special "(001.004S)" Standard ROM
